# ╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║                   后端服务环境变量配置示例
# ║              Backend Service Environment Variables Example
# ╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

# 📧 SMTP 邮件服务配置
# SMTP Mail Service Configuration
# 
# 说明 (Instructions):
# 1. 使用 Gmail SMTP 服务时，需要生成应用专用密码 (Google App Password)
#    Generate a Google App Password for Gmail SMTP:
#    https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 
# 2. MAIL_PASSWORD 应为 16 字符的应用专用密码，格式为: xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx
#    MAIL_PASSWORD should be a 16-character app-specific password
# 
# 3. 本地开发时，请复制此文件为 .env 并填入实际密码
#    For local development, copy this file to .env and fill in your password
#    $ cp .env.example .env
#
# ⚠️  安全提示 (SECURITY NOTICE):
#   - .env 文件已被 .gitignore 排除，不会被提交到 GitHub
#   - Never commit .env file containing sensitive information
#   - 不要在任何公开的文档或日志中包含密码
#   - Never include passwords in public documents or logs

MAIL_PASSWORD=xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx

# 📝 其他可选的环境变量配置 (Optional Environment Variables):
# 
# APP_ENV=development
# LOG_LEVEL=info
# HTTP_PORT=8080
# CONFIG_PATH=./configs/config.yaml
# WEBRTC_ICE_SERVERS_JSON='[{"urls":["stun:stun.l.google.com:19302"]},{"urls":["turn:your-ip:3478?transport=udp","turn:your-ip:3478?transport=tcp"],"username":"turnuser","credential":"turnpass"}]'
# ALIYUN_AK_ID=your_aliyun_access_key_id
# ALIYUN_AK_SECRET=your_aliyun_access_key_secret
# ALIYUN_ASR_APP_KEY=your_aliyun_asr_appkey
# ALIYUN_ASR_REGION=cn-shanghai
# ALIYUN_ASR_ENDPOINT=https://nls-gateway-cn-shanghai.aliyuncs.com
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your_openrouter_api_key
# OPENROUTER_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=deepseek/deepseek-chat

# ╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║                        本地开发启动指南
# ║                   Local Development Quick Start
# ╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
# 
# 步骤 1: 创建 .env 文件
# Step 1: Create .env file
#   $ cd backend
#   $ cp .env.example .env
# 
# 步骤 2: 填入你的 SMTP 密码
# Step 2: Fill in your SMTP password
#   编辑 .env 文件，将 MAIL_PASSWORD 替换为你的实际密码
#   Edit .env file and replace MAIL_PASSWORD with your actual password
# 
# 步骤 3: 启动后端服务
# Step 3: Start backend service
#   $ cd /path/to/allcall/backend
#   $ export MAIL_PASSWORD="your-16-char-password"
#   $ go run cmd/server/main.go
#
# 或使用 .env 文件 (Or use .env file):
#   $ godotenv -f .env go run cmd/server/main.go
